#metadata(title = "Mote Anchored Image Wrap", author = "Mote")

#document(
  default_font = "body",
  default_size = pt(10),
  page = { size = "letter" },
  margin = { top = pt(54), right = pt(72), bottom = pt(54), left = pt(72) }
)

#font(name = "body", latin = "Helvetica")

#style(
  name = "Normal",
  type = "paragraph",
  run = { font = "body", size = pt(10), color = "#111827" },
  paragraph = {
    spacing = {
      after = pt(7),
      line = { rule = "multiple", value = 1.08 }
    }
  }
)

#set paragraph(style = "Normal")

# Anchored Image Wrap

This case contrasts a right-anchored image with an ordinary inline image of the
same source and width. The anchored image must retain its aspect ratio while
nearby text wraps around its left edge.

#paragraph(fill = "#dbeafe")[
ANCHOR START — the image belongs at the right edge beside the following prose.
]

#image(
  "assets/mote-logo.png",
  alt = "Right-anchored asymmetric Mote logo",
  width = inch(1.8),
  placement = {
    type = "anchor",
    wrap = "square",
    horizontal = { relative_to = "column", alignment = "right" },
    vertical = { relative_to = "paragraph", alignment = "top" },
    margin = { left = pt(10), bottom = pt(6) }
  }
)

#paragraph[
WRAP 01 START — This sentence is deliberately long enough to occupy several
lines. While those lines are beside the logo, their right edge must stop before
the image and preserve the authored ten-point gap. — WRAP 01 END.
]

#paragraph[
WRAP 02 START — Text that reaches below the anchored logo must return to the
full body width without retaining a false right indent. The circle remains on
the left side of the image and the striped rectangle remains on the right. —
WRAP 02 END.
]

#paragraph(fill = "#dcfce7")[
ANCHOR END — no wrapped text may overlap the image, disappear behind it, or
remain narrowed after passing its bottom edge.
]

#paragraph(fill = "#fef3c7")[
INLINE CONTROL START — the next copy is an ordinary flow image and must consume
its own vertical space instead of allowing text beside it.
]

#image(
  "assets/mote-logo.png",
  alt = "Inline asymmetric Mote logo control",
  width = inch(1.8),
  alignment = "right",
  spacing = { before = pt(0), after = pt(7) }
)

#paragraph[
INLINE CONTROL END — this line must begin below the control image at the full
body width.
]

#paragraph(fill = "#dcfce7")[
PASS: the anchored logo is right aligned with square text wrapping and preserved
aspect ratio; the inline control occupies an ordinary full-width flow row.
]
